    variation__SuccessionCause__split["分割"]:::value
  end
  usecase__ApplyRenewal("継続（更新）の申請"):::usecase
  %% desc usecase__ApplyRenewal: 有効な許可の営業者が、満了の前に継続の許可を申請する（窓口・電子）。手数料と施設検査は新規と同じ手順で進む。
  usecase__AppointHygieneManager("食品衛生責任者の選定の届出"):::usecase
  %% desc usecase__AppointHygieneManager: 申請時に食品衛生責任者を定めていなかった営業者が、許可後に定めて（講習会を受けて）届け出る。
  usecase__ClassifyBusiness("営業の種類の判定"):::usecase
  %% desc usecase__ClassifyBusiness: 営業の種類から、許可が必要か、届出が必要か、どちらも要らないかを判定する。結果は営業の種類で決まり、監視員が選ぶものではない（各結果に条件）。
  usecase__DecideRevocation("許可の取消の決定"):::usecase
  %% desc usecase__DecideRevocation: 聴聞を経て許可を取り消すと決める。理由を示し、審査請求ができることを書面で教える。営業者は取消から2年は新たな許可を受けられないことがある。
  usecase__DecideSuspension("営業停止の決定"):::usecase
  %% desc usecase__DecideSuspension: 弁明の機会を経て、期間を定めて営業を停止すると決める。理由を示し、審査請求ができることを書面で教える。
  usecase__FileChangeNotice("変更届の提出"):::usecase
  %% desc usecase__FileChangeNotice: 許可営業者が、申請書の記載事項（営業者の氏名・住所、施設の名称、食品衛生責任者など）や設備の変更を届け出る。
  usecase__FileSuccessionNotice("地位承継届の提出"):::usecase
  %% desc usecase__FileSuccessionNotice: 営業を譲り受けた者、相続人、合併・分割で営業を承継した法人が、承継を証する書面を添えて届け出る。
  usecase__GrantPermit("許可の決定"):::usecase
  %% desc usecase__GrantPermit: 施設検査で施設基準に合うと認めた新規の申請に許可を与え、有効期間（5年以上）を付ける。
  usecase__HoldHearing("聴聞の実施"):::usecase
  %% desc usecase__HoldHearing: 聴聞の期日に名あて人の意見を聴き、記録する。取消の前には必ず行う。
  usecase__IssueCertificate("許可証の交付"):::usecase
  %% desc usecase__IssueCertificate: 許可証を営業者に交付する。
  usecase__NotifyOpinionProcedure("聴聞・弁明の通知"):::usecase
  %% desc usecase__NotifyOpinionProcedure: 予定する処分の内容と根拠条項、原因となる事実、聴聞の期日または弁明書の提出期限を、名あて人に書面で通知する。
  usecase__OrderImprovement("施設の整備改善命令"):::usecase
  %% desc usecase__OrderImprovement: 施設基準に合わない設備の改善を命じる。計測などで確かめた不充足なら意見陳述を省いて命じられる。
  usecase__PayPermitFee("許可申請手数料の納付"):::usecase
  %% desc usecase__PayPermitFee: 営業者が条例の手数料を保健所に納める（電子申請でも別途納付）。納めた手数料は還付されない。
  usecase__ProposeDisposition("処分の起案"):::usecase
  %% desc usecase__ProposeDisposition: 食品衛生監視員が違反の事実と処分基準から、処分の種類（整備改善命令・停止・取消）と意見陳述の手続（聴聞・弁明・省略）を起案する。
  usecase__PublishViolation("違反の公表"):::usecase
  %% desc usecase__PublishViolation: 処分を受けた営業者の名称、施設、処分の理由と内容をホームページと掲示場で公表する。
  usecase__ReceiveExplanation("弁明書の受理"):::usecase
  %% desc usecase__ReceiveExplanation: 停止や整備改善命令の前に、名あて人の弁明書を受け取る。期限までに出なければ、弁明の機会を与えたものとして手続を終える。
  usecase__RegisterPermit("許可台帳への登録"):::usecase
  %% desc usecase__RegisterPermit: 許可の決定を受けて許可番号を付け、許可台帳に登録する。電子申請ではシステムの表示を発行済にする。
  usecase__RenewPermit("更新の許可の決定"):::usecase
  %% desc usecase__RenewPermit: 施設検査で施設基準に合うと認めた継続の申請に、許可がまだ有効なうちに許可を与える。
  usecase__ReviewApplication("申請内容の確認と受理"):::usecase
  %% desc usecase__ReviewApplication: 許可担当が記載事項（営業者・施設・営業の種類・食品衛生責任者・図面・欠格事由の有無）と手数料の納付を確かめ、施設検査に進める（検査待）。
  usecase__ScheduleInspection("施設検査の日程調整"):::usecase
  %% desc usecase__ScheduleInspection: 手数料の納付を確かめた検査待の申請について、施設検査の日を決める。
  usecase__ScheduleSiteVisit("立入検査の予定"):::usecase
  %% desc usecase__ScheduleSiteVisit: 公表した計画の重点項目と件数に沿って、立入検査する施設を決める。
  usecase__StartBusiness("営業の開始・再開"):::usecase
  %% desc usecase__StartBusiness: 営業者が許可証を掲示して営業を始める。営業停止の期間が終わった後の再開も同じ。
  usecase__WithdrawApplication("申請の取下げ"):::usecase
  %% desc usecase__WithdrawApplication: 営業者が許可・不許可の前に申請を取り下げる。電子申請は保健所の差戻しを受けてから取り下げる。手数料は戻らない。
  condition__AwaitingInspection -.->|applies_to| usecase__ScheduleInspection
  condition__AwaitingInspection -.-> statemodel__PermitApplication_status
  %% derived condition__AwaitingInspection -> statemodel__PermitApplication_status from holds
  condition__BeforeReview -.->|applies_to| usecase__PayPermitFee
  condition__BeforeReview -.-> statemodel__PermitApplication_status
  %% derived condition__BeforeReview -> statemodel__PermitApplication_status from holds
  condition__CertifiedAndValid -.->|applies_to| usecase__StartBusiness
  condition__CertifiedAndValid -.-> statemodel__BusinessPermit_status
  %% derived condition__CertifiedAndValid -> statemodel__BusinessPermit_status from holds
  condition__CounterApplication -.-> statemodel__PermitApplication_status
  %% derived condition__CounterApplication -> statemodel__PermitApplication_status from when
  condition__CounterApplication -.-> variation__SubmissionChannel
  %% derived condition__CounterApplication -> variation__SubmissionChannel from holds
  condition__CounterApplication -.->|when| usecase__WithdrawApplication
  %% derived condition__CounterApplication -> usecase__WithdrawApplication via transitions PermitApplication.status submitted->withdrawn, transitions PermitApplication.status awaiting_inspection->withdrawn
  condition__DispositionDecided -.->|applies_to| usecase__PublishViolation
  condition__DispositionDecided -.-> statemodel__Disposition_status
  %% derived condition__DispositionDecided -> statemodel__Disposition_status from holds
  condition__ExemptType -.-> statemodel__Consultation_status
  %% derived condition__ExemptType -> statemodel__Consultation_status from when
  condition__ExemptType -.-> variation__BusinessType
  %% derived condition__ExemptType -> variation__BusinessType from holds
  condition__ExemptType -.->|when| usecase__ClassifyBusiness
  %% derived condition__ExemptType -> usecase__ClassifyBusiness via transitions Consultation.status open->exempt
  condition__ExplanationProcedure -.->|applies_to| usecase__ReceiveExplanation
  condition__ExplanationProcedure -.-> variation__OpinionProcedure
  %% derived condition__ExplanationProcedure -> variation__OpinionProcedure from holds
  condition__FeePaid -.->|applies_to| usecase__ReviewApplication
  condition__HearingProcedure -.->|applies_to| usecase__DecideRevocation
  condition__HearingProcedure -.->|applies_to| usecase__HoldHearing
  condition__HearingProcedure -.-> variation__OpinionProcedure
  %% derived condition__HearingProcedure -> variation__OpinionProcedure from holds
  condition__ImprovementOrderKind -.->|applies_to| usecase__OrderImprovement
  condition__ImprovementOrderKind -.-> variation__DispositionKind
  %% derived condition__ImprovementOrderKind -> variation__DispositionKind from holds
  condition__ImprovementOrderKind -.-> variation__OpinionProcedure
  %% derived condition__ImprovementOrderKind -> variation__OpinionProcedure from when
  condition__ImprovementOrderKind -.->|when| usecase__ProposeDisposition
  %% derived condition__ImprovementOrderKind -> usecase__ProposeDisposition via chooses Disposition.procedure omitted
  condition__InspectionPassed -.->|applies_to| usecase__GrantPermit
  condition__InspectionPassed -.->|applies_to| usecase__RenewPermit
  condition__InspectionPassed -.-> statemodel__Inspection_status
  %% derived condition__InspectionPassed -> statemodel__Inspection_status from holds
  condition__NewApplication -.->|applies_to| usecase__GrantPermit
  condition__NewApplication -.-> variation__ApplicationKind
  %% derived condition__NewApplication -> variation__ApplicationKind from holds
  condition__NoPermitYet -.->|applies_to| usecase__RegisterPermit
  condition__NoPermitYet -.-> variation__ApplicationKind
  %% derived condition__NoPermitYet -> variation__ApplicationKind from holds
  condition__NotRevocation -.-> variation__DispositionKind
  %% derived condition__NotRevocation -> variation__DispositionKind from holds
  condition__NotRevocation -.-> variation__OpinionProcedure
  %% derived condition__NotRevocation -> variation__OpinionProcedure from when
  condition__NotRevocation -.->|when| usecase__ProposeDisposition
  %% derived condition__NotRevocation -> usecase__ProposeDisposition via chooses Disposition.procedure explanation
  condition__NotificationRequiredType -.-> statemodel__Consultation_status
  %% derived condition__NotificationRequiredType -> statemodel__Consultation_status from when
  condition__NotificationRequiredType -.-> variation__BusinessType
  %% derived condition__NotificationRequiredType -> variation__BusinessType from holds
  condition__NotificationRequiredType -.->|when| usecase__ClassifyBusiness
  %% derived condition__NotificationRequiredType -> usecase__ClassifyBusiness via transitions Consultation.status open->notification_required
  condition__OpinionOmitted -.-> statemodel__Disposition_status
  %% derived condition__OpinionOmitted -> statemodel__Disposition_status from when
  condition__OpinionOmitted -.-> variation__OpinionProcedure
  %% derived condition__OpinionOmitted -> variation__OpinionProcedure from holds
  condition__OpinionOmitted -.->|when| usecase__OrderImprovement
  %% derived condition__OpinionOmitted -> usecase__OrderImprovement via transitions Disposition.status proposed->decided
  condition__OpinionRequired -.->|applies_to| usecase__NotifyOpinionProcedure
  condition__OpinionRequired -.-> variation__OpinionProcedure
  %% derived condition__OpinionRequired -> variation__OpinionProcedure from holds
  condition__PermitNotEnded -.->|applies_to| usecase__FileChangeNotice
  condition__PermitNotEnded -.->|applies_to| usecase__FileSuccessionNotice
  condition__PermitNotEnded -.-> statemodel__BusinessPermit_status
  %% derived condition__PermitNotEnded -> statemodel__BusinessPermit_status from holds
  condition__PermitRequiredType -.-> statemodel__Consultation_status
  %% derived condition__PermitRequiredType -> statemodel__Consultation_status from when
  condition__PermitRequiredType -.-> variation__BusinessType
  %% derived condition__PermitRequiredType -> variation__BusinessType from holds
  condition__PermitRequiredType -.->|when| usecase__ClassifyBusiness
  %% derived condition__PermitRequiredType -> usecase__ClassifyBusiness via transitions Consultation.status open->permit_required
  condition__PermitValid -.->|applies_to| usecase__AppointHygieneManager
  condition__PermitValid -.->|applies_to| usecase__IssueCertificate
  condition__PermitValid -.-> statemodel__BusinessPermit_status
  %% derived condition__PermitValid -> statemodel__BusinessPermit_status from holds
  condition__PlanPublished -.->|applies_to| usecase__ScheduleSiteVisit
  condition__PlanPublished -.-> statemodel__MonitoringPlan_status
  %% derived condition__PlanPublished -> statemodel__MonitoringPlan_status from holds
  condition__RenewalApplication -.->|applies_to| usecase__RenewPermit
  condition__RenewalApplication -.-> variation__ApplicationKind
  %% derived condition__RenewalApplication -> variation__ApplicationKind from holds
  condition__RenewsValidPermit -.->|applies_to| usecase__ApplyRenewal
  condition__RenewsValidPermit -.->|applies_to| usecase__RenewPermit
  condition__RenewsValidPermit -.-> statemodel__BusinessPermit_status
  %% derived condition__RenewsValidPermit -> statemodel__BusinessPermit_status from holds
  condition__RevocationKind -.->|applies_to| usecase__DecideRevocation
  condition__RevocationKind -.-> variation__DispositionKind
  %% derived condition__RevocationKind -> variation__DispositionKind from holds
  condition__SuspensionKind -.->|applies_to| usecase__DecideSuspension
  condition__SuspensionKind -.-> variation__DispositionKind
  %% derived condition__SuspensionKind -> variation__DispositionKind from holds
